Or I've come to see you because I'm confused, I don't quite know what senior management has decided and therefore what I'm supposed to be doing.

244
00:18:44,160 --> 00:18:46,730
I need clarification.

245
00:18:47,270 --> 00:18:51,550
Control, the old military rule is that

246
00:18:51,550 --> 00:18:56,150
the first rule of warfare is to control the battlefield.

247
00:18:56,710 --> 00:18:57,750
Control the battlefield.

248
00:18:58,650 --> 00:19:01,530
You set the stage and do your homework,

249
