00:20:26,020 --> 00:20:31,040
we'll have to postpone the redesign of the water cooler again. If you don't get it in writing,

263
00:20:31,460 --> 00:20:38,580
these things just get lost. Then you legitimately and understandably blame your subordinate. He got

264
00:20:38,580 --> 00:20:45,920
me onto very thin ice i made him promise that he can have carter and now i'm suddenly in trouble

265
00:20:45,920 --> 00:20:52,640
one always puts it in writing there are few things that are cheap in an abundant supply

