00:21:14,550 --> 00:21:16,840
He's working on the water cooler.

271
00:21:17,380 --> 00:21:22,950
Why you don't need those flimsies in which you confirm to your boss

272
00:21:22,950 --> 00:21:24,590
that that's what you're going to do?

273
00:21:25,290 --> 00:21:26,650
And he doesn't need it either.

