00:32:13,700 --> 00:32:20,340
more than a fairly small part of your time in meetings is a sign of lack of control,

374
00:32:21,170 --> 00:32:30,650
a sign of poor organization of your work, a sign above all that you substitute meeting for thinking.

375
00:32:31,210 --> 00:32:38,020
Control them and don't let them become a habit. Don't have a meeting unless you have a purpose.

