00:34:57,010 --> 00:35:03,170
Or you say, are you going to call him up or am I going to call him up?

401
00:35:03,760 --> 00:35:09,760
Or you want a meeting in which that problem with that supplier there

402
00:35:09,760 --> 00:35:16,940
is a pretext for, I hate to use that jargon,

403
00:35:17,080 --> 00:35:19,220
for an interpersonal relationship.

404
00:35:19,640 --> 00:35:24,600
And then you need 50 minutes or an hour because it takes that long

405
00:35:24,600 --> 00:35:29,320
for people to establish the rapport that's necessary

406
00:35:29,320 --> 00:35:32,180
for either you or your subordinate

407
00:35:32,180 --> 00:35:35,000
to talk about what you really want to talk about,

