understand a subject matter. They have done their writing job. That, as any professional

417
00:36:24,820 --> 00:36:31,120
writer can tell them, is when the writing job becomes possible. Then one sits down and says,

418
00:36:31,220 --> 00:36:39,030
now I understand what I'm talking about, and now I have to think through whom I am talking to.

419
00:36:39,770 --> 00:36:46,290
One of the oldest rules is that logic comes first, but then comes rhetoric, the art of effectiveness.

420
00:36:46,290 --> 00:36:49,410
And reports are written to be effective.

421
00:36:50,100 --> 00:36:54,740
What most reports need to be effective management tools

422
00:36:54,740 --> 00:36:58,310
