00:37:23,160 --> 00:37:25,400
In the military, this is being taught.

431
00:37:26,910 --> 00:37:34,390
After you have done your staff work, you sit down and write the covering letter,

432
00:37:35,810 --> 00:37:37,250
which has one question.

433
00:37:37,410 --> 00:37:43,600
Who is going to read it and what is he expected to do with it?

434
00:37:43,680 --> 00:37:44,840
How do we tell him?

435
00:37:45,380 --> 00:37:48,740
The military and system is being one page all right.

436
00:37:48,740 --> 00:37:54,140
I think that's not a bad rule, but one doesn't have to be that pedantic.

437
00:37:54,840 --> 00:38:00,320
Make it four if you have an executive committee that likes to read, a good many of them do.

438
00:38:01,080 --> 00:38:10,680
Concern yourself with the effectiveness of the report, because by itself it will be literature and not action.

439
00:38:10,680 --> 00:38:27,050
so much it really may be number three and number four assignment control and performance

